  "states": {
    "nether_thoughts_1": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "I can't even think because it's too hot..."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "text": "..."
          },
          "next": "nether_thoughts_2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "nether_thoughts_2": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "I've gone into the Nether a few times to look for Netherite and smaller things like Glowstone Dust and Nether Wart... but I failed on the Netherite part."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "text": "..."
          },
          "next": "nether_thoughts_3"
        }
      ]
    },
    "nether_thoughts_3": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "Simply because I can't stand the heat or some of the denizens here."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "text": "..."
          },
          "next": "nether_thoughts_4"
        }
      ]
    },
    "nether_thoughts_4": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "I kind of like the biomes, especially the Crimson Forest. It reminds me of the color of my dragon..."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "text": "..."
          },
          "next": "nether_thoughts_5"
        }
      ]
    },
    "nether_thoughts_5": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "Also, I absolutely hate the Piglins. I almost got jumped because I forgot to wear my gold helmet."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "text": "..."
          },
          "next": "nether_thoughts_6"
        }
      ]
    },
    "nether_thoughts_6": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "Don't get me started on the Ghasts. Why do they make those weird sounds? How can they float? Why do they look so creepy? I didn't do anything to them, and I still got a fireball shot at me?!"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "text": "..."
          },
          "next": "nether_thoughts_7"
        }
      ]
    },
    "nether_thoughts_7": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "Striders are just weird old men with toothpicks for legs, standing in a lake of lava."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "text": "..."
          },
          "next": "nether_thoughts_8"
        }
      ]
    },
    "nether_thoughts_8": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "I tried luring one onto land and dragging it back to the Overworld, but seeing it shiver out of the lava made me pity it."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "text": "..."
          },
          "next": "nether_thoughts_9"
        }
      ]
    },
    "nether_thoughts_9": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "And Wither Skeletons and Blazes? Absolutely not. Bunch of freaks..."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "text": "..."
          },
          "next": "nether_thoughts_10"
        }
      ]
    },
    "nether_thoughts_10": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "The point is, the Nether is weird, which circles back to it having its own charm, I think. And I only came along because you're with me. Otherwise, I'd never look twice at it."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "text": "..."
          },
          "next": "nether_thoughts_11",
          "set_flag": "ivy_nether_dialogue_done"
        }
      ]
    },
    "nether_thoughts_11": {
      "type": "end_dialogue",
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "I'm sweating a lot right now... Let's just hurry up with whatever you're trying to do and get out of this place, please?"
      }
    }
  }
}
